     "<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c50\"><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c50\"><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c50\"><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c50\"><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c163\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Hi </span>D-RUG<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">gies! </span><br>\r\n</font></div><div><br></div><div>This Thursday will be the last D-RUG and Tea Time for the Fall Quarter (details below).<br></div><div><br></div><div><div>D-RUG: 10am-noon, DataLab Classroom, Library 360, and zoom <font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" title=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd%3DS0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464516863000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LPBJRvSWVi1l7gy8-d82f\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09</a><br>\r\n</font>\r\n</div><div>Tea Time: 1-2pm, DataLab Classroom, Library 360</div><div>Co-working: 2-4pm, DataLab Conference Room, Library 362<br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Additionally, next week DataLab will be running the following workshops. Make sure to register to reserve your spot. <br></div><div><ul><li><a href=\"https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/instructor-training-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/instructor-training-2024&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464516863000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bxho8pYh89Y-z0J2Fyzrx\">Introduction to Computational Pedagogy</a> - Best practices for teaching scientific computing (ex data analysis with R and Python)</li><li><a href=\"https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/reproducible-research-intensive-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/reproducible-research-intensive-2024&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464516863000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1u2b_qviDFD42cdxpEcxg2\">Introduction to Reproducible and Collaborative Computational Research Practices</a> - Learn how to use Github! </li><li><a href=\"https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/r-basics-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/r-basics-2024&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464516863000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EFy2dQWq8j-lawhQBbJYm\">R Basics</a> - Learn R from the ground up. A great workshop for absolute beginners and also those with some experience, looking to fill in gaps in their knowledge.<br></li><li><a href=\"https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/python-basics-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/python-basics-2024&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464516863000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3j1LLBi5Q9uabMG0zBSLuZ\">Python Basics</a> - Were you told you needed to learn python in addition to R? This is the workshop for you.<br></li></ul></div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Please consider posting your questions to our <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" title=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464516863000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3gkAS63u0p9-wr0a05Xda7\">Discourse</a> site\r\n in advance\r\n of attending D-RUG virtually. This helps us do a better job of \r\nanswering your questions, and also keep a log of the types of questions \r\nwe see frequently.</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\" style=\"line-height:1.2\">See you then,</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\" style=\"line-height:1.2\">Your D-RUG Coo[R]dinators </font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
